		{"id":"b34b60ad6bd85f67","type":"text","text":"Core","x":-200,"y":-340,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"904196984cccefcf","type":"text","text":"The core controls loading different segments of the map, loading save data\n\nIt will also take charge of placing the player in the correct transition","x":-274,"y":-240,"width":399,"height":160},
		{"id":"6abc2eb20f349441","type":"text","text":"Scene tree will look like this:\n\nCore\n- Current Game Scene\n\t- Tilemap\n\t- Player","x":418,"y":-337,"width":250,"height":297},
		{"id":"649f4853b74ed44b","type":"text","text":"Base Systems to make the core of the game\n\n**Make the core of the game then basically just release content updates**\n\n","x":-274,"y":20,"width":393,"height":122},
		{"id":"80e5942676d6431c","type":"file","file":"Game Notes/Systems/Systems.md","x":-488,"y":307,"width":821,"height":554},
		{"id":"2dd501d1a357c9af","x":480,"y":445,"width":250,"height":279,"type":"text","text":"The point of these modules is that they can be reused for multiple objects\n\nAn enemy will have the same modules as a tree and reuse the same code"}
